          '<p class="muted" style="margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px;">'
            'Reference: <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/ai-agents/governance-security-across-organization" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CAF · Governance and security for AI agents across the organization</a>'
